displayName: Extra Wave Sounds
name: extra-wave-sounds
author: Mythril
description:
    '''
    Adds extra wave sounds. There are currently only three:
    - Imminent (Plays when a wave before a wave with a guardian starts.)
    - Guardian (Plays when a wave with a guardian starts.)
    - Final (Plays when the final wave starts.)
    
    This idea was actually taken from my other (most likely discontinued) mod.
    '''
subtitle: v1.0.0
version: 1.0.0
minGameVersion: 149
repo: Mythril382/Extra-Wave-Sounds